computer.tflite and computer.json
  Community V2 "computer" microWakeWord model by Leland Olney.
  https://github.com/JohnnyPrimus/Custom_V2_MicroWakeWords
  Apache-2.0

silero_vad.onnx
  Silero VAD weights exported by k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx.
  https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
  The export is Apache-2.0. Silero VAD itself is MIT.

melspectrogram.onnx and embedding_model.onnx
  openWakeWord shared frontend by David Scripka, copied from the oww-rs tree.
  https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord
  Apache-2.0

The "computer" verifier classifier is not included. The daemon rejects every
trigger until that ONNX file is present at the path in voice.toml.
